# E42 卡B ⑤ — mingge-relay Worker `/study` featured passthrough(獨立 artifact/commit)
# Worker: mingge-relay (tag a325768bf5f64151bd8bccebe2818ad6);來源=Cloudflare 部署版
# 最小必要 diff = /study handler 的 fields 陣列加欄名 "featured" 一項(以欄名取值,同既有 title/body/content_type;featured 欄名無 BOM)
# 不改結構/不新端點/不動 filterByFormula/不動驗身。🔴 禁前端直連 Airtable、禁持 key。
